  "description": "The ROSE Bruce is the bike to realise yourself – whether slopestyle, dirt, street or pump track, get creative and find your own style. With its manoeuvrable geometry and agility, it offers you the control you need for spectacular tricks. The frame was developed with a focus on manoeuvrability and durability, so that the bike meets the requirements of even the most demanding riders. Being equipped with high-quality components such as the Maxxis Ikon and DTH tyres, it leaves nothing to be desired. The dropouts allow for easy chain tensioning and ensure trouble-free handling so that nothing stands in the way when you're conquering the dirt track. ¹ approx. 11.5 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for cloud frame, size M, without pedals",
